    "details": "The Apache Traffic Server project published security advisories for\nissues fixed in releases 10.1.1 through 10.1.5. They include request\nsmuggling and cache poisoning through malformed requests and responses,\nmemory corruption, and unauthenticated access in the experimental\nplugins, which the port builds (tsmemcache, wasm, and magick with the\nIMAGEMAGICK option).\n",
